flowchart TD
    A[Start Verification Step: target_evaluations++] --> B{For each token i in K}
    B -->|Next i| C[Calculate acc_prob = min 1, pt/pd]
    C --> D{random <= acc_prob?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Append draft_tokens i]
    E --> E2[accepted_tokens_count++]
    E2 --> B
    D -->|No| F[Append resample_token_id]
    F --> F2[accepted_tokens_count++]
    F2 --> H[kv_cache_length += len accepted]
    H --> Z[Return accepted, kv_cache_length]
    B -->|All K Accepted| I[Append fallback_token_id]
    I --> I2[accepted_tokens_count++]
    I2 --> J[kv_cache_length += len accepted]
    J --> Z
